      "writtenOn": "2021-05-19T04:09:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A comment that explains this part would be helpful.  It\u0027s related to having to build multiple __init functions into the fips140.ko module, right?  How is it guaranteed that they are run in the right order?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6,
