        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-19T04:09:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be disabled by default, and enabled by gki_defconfig.\n\nAlso, what is the plan for when fips140.ko will be built?  Will it be build as part of GKI, or as part of the modules for a particular device?  I guess the former, since we\u0027ll want to do the certification just once, for GKI?  Do we have a way to build modules as part of GKI?  I recall there was going to be a way to do that, but I don\u0027t know whether it went through or not -- as-is I don\u0027t see anything set to \u0027m\u0027 in gki_defconfig.",
      "revId": "7284f0af63f3973eef9d971b00c7f5ef37d50428",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
